Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, xfce4-panel (>= 4.16.0)
Description: MPRIS media player control plugin for the Xfce panel
 A panel plugin for xfce4-panel that controls music playback over
 MPRIS/D-Bus. Works with any player exposing the
 org.mpris.MediaPlayer2 interface -- Spotify, VLC, Rhythmbox,
 browsers, mpv and others -- with no per-application integration
 required.
 .
 Shows the current track's title/artist/album, optional album art,
 a progress bar with elapsed/total time, and previous/play-pause/next
 controls, all configurable from the plugin's own preferences dialog.
